<section class="space--sm">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="row justify-content-center">
      <div class="col-lg-10 text-center">
        <span class="landing-eyebrow">Help</span>
        <h1 class="landing-title">How MyDay helps you track wellbeing and meaningful work</h1>
        <p class="lead mb-4">MyDay is built around daily awareness, gentle reflection, and purposeful progress. Use this page to explore the features and learn how they fit together.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="space--sm">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="row">
      <div class="col-md-6">
        <h2 class="landing-section-title">Daily wellbeing tracking</h2>
        <p class="landing-section-text">Start each day by checking in with the core signals that shape your mood and energy. MyDay helps you notice patterns so you can repeat what works and fix what drains you.</p>
        <ul class="feature-list feature-list--details">
          <li>
            <i class="material-icons align-middle mr-2">sentiment_very_satisfied</i>
            <strong>Mood tracking</strong>
            <span>Record how you feel over time and discover what lifts or lowers your mood.</span>
          </li>
          <li>
            <i class="material-icons align-middle mr-2">battery_charging_full</i>
            <strong>Energy levels</strong>
            <span>Track your energy each day so you can protect your focus and avoid burnout.</span>
          </li>
          <li>
            <i class="material-icons align-middle mr-2">explore</i>
            <strong>Alignment</strong>
            <span>Use your reflections and project work to keep your time pointed at what matters.</span>
          </li>
          <li>
            <i class="material-icons align-middle mr-2">star</i>
            <strong>Progress over time</strong>
            <span>See how your habits and choices affect your wellbeing with charts and history.</span>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="col-md-6">
        <div class="reflection-showcase">
          <%= image_tag "dashboard_page.png", class: "img-fluid rounded", alt: "Daily Wellbeing Dashboard" %>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="space--sm bg--secondary">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="row text-center mb-5">
      <div class="col-md-12">
        <h2 class="landing-section-title">Daily reflection tools</h2>
        <p class="landing-section-subtitle">MyDay makes it easy to capture the things that matter most each day.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="row">
      <div class="col-md-4 text-center">
        <div class="feature-box feature-box--small">
          <i class="material-icons feature-icon">mood</i>
          <h4 class="feature-title">Reflections</h4>
          <p class="feature-text">Write about your day so you can learn from what worked and what didn't.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="col-md-4 text-center">
        <div class="feature-box feature-box--small">
          <i class="material-icons feature-icon">flag</i>
          <h4 class="feature-title">Biggest challenges</h4>
          <p class="feature-text">Capture the one problem that, if fixed, would make tomorrow noticeably better.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="col-md-4 text-center">
        <div class="feature-box feature-box--small">
          <i class="material-icons feature-icon">favorite</i>
          <h4 class="feature-title">Gratitude</h4>
          <p class="feature-text">End your day by naming what you appreciate so your attention shifts toward the positive.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="row mt-4">
      <div class="col-md-4 text-center">
        <div class="feature-box feature-box--small">
          <i class="material-icons feature-icon">school</i>
          <h4 class="feature-title">Lessons learned</h4>
          <p class="feature-text">Capture a daily lesson so you can improve your habits week after week.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="col-md-4 text-center">
        <div class="feature-box feature-box--small">
          <i class="material-icons feature-icon">trending_up</i>
          <h4 class="feature-title">Day ratings</h4>
          <p class="feature-text">Rate your day and compare progress in the habit loop that supports growth.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="col-md-4 text-center">
        <div class="feature-box feature-box--small">
          <i class="material-icons feature-icon">psychology</i>
          <h4 class="feature-title">Mood history</h4>
          <p class="feature-text">Look back at your mood entries to identify recurring trends.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="space--sm">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="row align-items-center">
      <div class="col-md-6">
        <h2 class="landing-section-title">Projects and meaningful work</h2>
        <p class="landing-section-text">Projects are where your meaningful work lives. MyDay helps you move from vague goals to clear actions every day.</p>
        <ul class="feature-list feature-list--details">
          <li>
            <i class="material-icons align-middle mr-2">check_circle</i>
            <strong>Todos</strong>
            <span>Create and complete focused tasks that keep your projects moving.</span>
          </li>
          <li>
            <i class="material-icons align-middle mr-2">timer</i>
            <strong>Time tracking</strong>
            <span>Open and close sessions to track progress and build better habits.</span>
          </li>
          <li>
            <i class="material-icons align-middle mr-2">description</i>
            <strong>Posts</strong>
            <span>Write about your work to clarify what gives you energy and where you need to course-correct.</span>
          </li>
          <li>
            <i class="material-icons align-middle mr-2">book</i>
            <strong>Materials</strong>
            <span>Keep notes, references, and study resources organized by project.</span>
          </li>
          <li>
            <i class="material-icons align-middle mr-2">link</i>
            <strong>Saved links</strong>
            <span>Store useful web resources so you can return to them without disrupting your flow.</span>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="col-md-6">
        <div class="project-showcase">
          <%= image_tag "project.png", class: "img-fluid rounded", alt: "Project features" %>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="space--sm bg--secondary">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="row text-center mb-5">
      <div class="col-md-12">
        <h2 class="landing-section-title">Extra tools to support your flow</h2>
        <p class="landing-section-subtitle">Use these additional features to stay organized and motivated.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="row">
      <div class="col-md-4 text-center">
        <div class="feature-box feature-box--small">
          <i class="material-icons feature-icon">emoji_events</i>
          <h4 class="feature-title">Gamification</h4>
          <p class="feature-text">Earn points and achievements for creating habits, completing tasks, and staying consistent.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="col-md-4 text-center">
        <div class="feature-box feature-box--small">
          <i class="material-icons feature-icon">notifications</i>
          <h4 class="feature-title">Notifications</h4>
          <p class="feature-text">Get reminders and updates for the parts of your routine that matter most.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="col-md-4 text-center">
        <div class="feature-box feature-box--small">
          <i class="material-icons feature-icon">search</i>
          <h4 class="feature-title">Knowledge search</h4>
          <p class="feature-text">Search and find important ideas, notes, and reflections across your account.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="space--sm">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="row justify-content-center">
      <div class="col-lg-8 text-center">
        <h2 class="landing-section-title">How to get started</h2>
        <p class="landing-section-text">If you are new to MyDay, start by creating an account and visiting your dashboard. Add one reflection, one gratitude, and one project task today to build momentum.</p>
        <p class="landing-section-text">If you already use MyDay, the help page is always available at <%= help_path %>. Use it to remember where each feature lives and how it supports your daily growth.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
